# THE GS-QUANT ORACLE'S PIN (README.md): the gs-quant release every answer here is snapped with, one fact. Plain
# KEY=VALUE, as tools/oracle-pins.env. requirements.txt reads it (pip expands ${GS_QUANT_VERSION}), snap.sh installs
# from requirements.txt, snap.py refuses any other installed release, and //core:ts_gsquant_parity_test reads it.
GS_QUANT_VERSION=2.2.3
